        "**Moving Average Method**\n",
        "Method Used:\n",
        "Averages the last 30 days’ opening prices to predict the next day's price.\n",
        "\n",
        "Limitation: Cannot project into the future beyond the window size."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "ScDZCnlg7Iz5"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "#Compute 30-Day Moving Average\n",
        "df[\"SMA_30\"] = df[\"y\"].rolling(window=30).mean()\n",
        "\n",
        "# Step 4: Predict Next Day’s Opening Price\n",
        "predicted_sma = df[\"SMA_30\"].iloc[-1]\n",
        "print(f\"Predicted Opening Price (Moving Average): {predicted_sma:.2f} INR\")\n",
        "\n",
        "# Step 5: Plot Moving Average\n",
        "plt.figure(figsize=(12,5))\n",
        "plt.plot(df[\"y\"], label=\"Actual Opening Price\", color=\"black\")\n",
        "plt.plot(df[\"SMA_30\"], label=\"30-Day Moving Average\", color=\"blue\")\n",
        "plt.xlabel(\"Date\")\n",
        "plt.ylabel(\"Stock Opening Price (INR)\")\n",
